5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time! I'll look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I'll focus on the practicalities of the site's usage. I'll examine the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,"I think it's important to know who will take care of the park. I'll look into the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, and the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I want to see how previous projects have held up. I will look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the long-term financial burden. I will look into the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,Does anyone else think we should check the soil or the drainage? I'm worried about surprises once we start digging.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, I have already included the drainage callouts in my list, which should give us a good indication of how the ground is behaving.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minato,,I hope the volunteer groups can help us. Maybe they know things about the park that aren't in the official reports?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,"That is a possibility, Minato. However, I believe the physical evidence of past failures will be more reliable than anecdotes when we evaluate these plans.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Minako. Hard data on maintenance and funding will provide the most honest picture of what we can actually sustain.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I guess you're right! I'll stick with my choices then, but I hope the phasing notes show we can keep the park open while we work.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"I suspect the crossing counts will reveal that people have very specific habits here, which any successful plan must accommodate if it is to be truly functional.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,I wonder if the groundskeeping roll will show if there are enough people to help the volunteers. I hope we can find a way to make it work for everyone.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I am curious to see if the eastern avenue planting failed due to poor design or simply a lack of care. It will tell us if we can trust the new plans.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I will be interested to see if the habitat fund's terms restrict us to certain types of development, as that will heavily influence the financial viability of the candidates.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited to see what we find! Let's hope the information helps us pick the best plan for the city.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
