22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I believe we have a comprehensive set of inquiries. I am ready to see the results.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
