24,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I'm looking forward to it too. I hope we can find a plan that makes everyone happy.
Minato:","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
